  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">You can choose a Target when you attack it or by skipping your Move, declaring it as your Mark until you declare a new Mark. The following rules apply while you have a Mark:</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Your attacks against it with Weapons that have the Keen or Vicious property also have the other property, and Crit if a Bonus causes the result to exceed your Crit range.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• You roll two d20s on Checks to track it, and use the higher result.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Macro:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> @UUID[Compendium.vagabond-app.macros.Macro.A3nrEX73yauzzZFA]{Hunter's Mark}</span></p>",
